                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "91261134-0011-35c3-ab88-3c31e1467ab3",
                        "entry_id": "e590e677-b5d3-3072-b023-b4814bc544a6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "van iets of iemand dat het gekeurd kan worden; openstaan voor kritiek"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6fad0ae7-7dd4-4148-8b1b-70f14c239212",
                                "sense_id": "91261134-0011-35c3-ab88-3c31e1467ab3",
                                "text": "Zij reageerde daarmee op de scherpe kritiek die de advocaten in de zaak eerder op de dag uitten op de inzet van de undercovers. Die zou oncontroleerbaar en niet toetsbaar zijn geweest. In de zaak werden in januari, bijna twaalf jaar na de roof, zeven verdachten aangehouden. Vijf van hen zitten nog vast en werden woensdag voorgeleid aan de rechtbank."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb43f4b8-0a88-4174-a4db-b77baf558ccf",
                                "sense_id": "91261134-0011-35c3-ab88-3c31e1467ab3",
                                "text": "De IGZ staat daar nog steeds achter. „Huisarts Tromp liet zich die dag leiden door impulsen, anticipeerde niet, communiceerde niet en stelde zich niet toetsbaar op”, zei de advocate van de IGZ donderdag. Volgens haar moest de IGZ ingrijpen om te kunnen onderzoeken of er meer aan de hand was."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "94f037d7-ba52-4d27-b6fd-ace9129fc05a",
                        "source_entry_id": "e590e677-b5d3-3072-b023-b4814bc544a6",
                        "source_sense_id": "91261134-0011-35c3-ab88-3c31e1467ab3",
                        "target_lang_word": "verifiable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "verifiable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e01bc505-369b-37d4-ba49-2ac15f2f6b00",
                                        "entry_id": "8525c203-71b7-3a30-befc-5b3c176bfdbf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Able to be verified or confirmed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a443852f-b5b6-44a4-bf67-089b70259ca2",
                                                "sense_id": "e01bc505-369b-37d4-ba49-2ac15f2f6b00",
                                                "text": "Do you have verifiable evidence to support that claim?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8320eac5-e0bb-475a-8b57-2c808a8b122e",
                                                "sense_id": "e01bc505-369b-37d4-ba49-2ac15f2f6b00",
                                                "text": "Sometimes these sagas and anecdotes are touched with ribaldry, or with excessive obscenity, according to the times, and sometimes they are rooted in obscure but still verifiable deistic concepts."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3804487-a747-44f7-99c9-2e8a9f27a2c2",
                                                "sense_id": "e01bc505-369b-37d4-ba49-2ac15f2f6b00",
                                                "text": "But the post-truthism that the new autocrats are so apt at employing goes far beyond fibbing: it denies the existence of a verifiable reality. Post-truthism is not chiefly about getting lies accepted as truths but about muddying the waters to the point that it becomes difficult to discern the difference between truth and falsehood."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc61d8d3-9810-37ef-9ff4-d6abf6f87a99",
                                        "entry_id": "8525c203-71b7-3a30-befc-5b3c176bfdbf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Able to be qualified by a Boolean expression."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
